:::{style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 22px;"}
:::{.columns}
:::{.column width="50%"}
- [cudf.pandas](https://docs.rapids.ai/api/cudf/stable/cudf_pandas/) accelerates pandas from [one line]{.alert}
